# Debugging notes:

One can use following in interactive python console to dive into the book database:

```python
from app.book import BookDir
from app.book import Cache

cache = Cache.get_instance("/home/yannick/Projects/python/ebookonline/cache")
bdir = BookDir("book.db")
bdir.scan_dir("/home/yannick/Projects/python/ebookonline/books")
```
